    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look what the mouse dragged in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and drag to cast your <strong>Spell Box</strong> and capture waves of <strong>Draggins</strong>, but be careful! Your <strong>Spell Box</strong> is vulnerable to attacks. Dodge, weave, and swoop in for tactical blows, all while strategizing your ideal build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover new types of <strong>Draggins</strong> in each locale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn <strong>Spells</strong> and drink <strong>Potions</strong> to power up as the challenge intensifies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/292ad978eae4fb8e4767b7f9fb734b86.poster.avif?t=1755529234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/292ad978eae4fb8e4767b7f9fb734b86.webm?t=1755529234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/292ad978eae4fb8e4767b7f9fb734b86.mp4?t=1755529234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It just keeps draggin' on!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new builds and strategies with each run while overcoming <strong>Challenges</strong> to earn <strong>Spells</strong> and <strong>Outfits</strong>. Change the way you play as you strive for higher heights and get Margot some fresh fits!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ <strong>Challenges</strong> to hunt with each run for some sweet rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new kinds of <strong>Spells</strong> to make your attacks even spicier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill out Margot's <strong>Wardrobe</strong> and customize your <strong>Spell Box</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/d5d8960202e2699bee715b37bae6b132.poster.avif?t=1755529234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/d5d8960202e2699bee715b37bae6b132.webm?t=1755529234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/d5d8960202e2699bee715b37bae6b132.mp4?t=1755529234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What a drag!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get <i>lost-in-the-box</i> as you're dragged into the experience of <strong>Draggin'!</strong> Enjoy the charming pixel aesthetics as you explore each environment, outfit your mouse in some rad regalia, power through <strong>Challenges</strong> 'til you achieve it all, and jump in for <strong><i>just one more run!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/c58c73464eb310bf9fe9d4c6d7d0e822.poster.avif?t=1755529234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/c58c73464eb310bf9fe9d4c6d7d0e822.webm?t=1755529234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/c58c73464eb310bf9fe9d4c6d7d0e822.mp4?t=1755529234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
